  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Somewhere in Central Continent, while Fang Yuan is trapped in Zhou Xiong Xin’s rumor cage, Shen Cong Sheng says Fang Yuan is likely in an immortal formation or immortal battlefield, that he can barely sense him anymore, and that their connection is about to be broken. When Fang Yuan went after Eastern Sea’s Dragon Palace, this investigative method had hit him unknowingly. Song Qi Yuan, standing beside him, sighs that Brother Shen’s investigative methods are admirable, and recalls being hit by them years ago. Shen Cong Sheng laughs that they were still young, and that Song Qi Yuan stole an inheritance secretly, leaving them with no gains despite hard work.",
      "chapters": [
        1700
      ],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "reg_central_continent",
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "char_zhou_xiong_xin",
        "reg_eastern_sea",
        "house_dragon_palace",
        "char_song_qi_yuan",
        "char_great_scholar_shen"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Song Qi Yuan, Qing Yue An, Shen Cong Sheng, Zhang Yin, Granny Rong, Shi Miao, and others are gathered, all rank eight. Shen Cong Sheng leads the way and says Dragon Palace is nearby. Duke Long had snatched a rank eight Immortal Gu House from these Eastern Sea rank eights. During the Refinement Path Convention they gathered secretly to obtain Dragon Palace and salvage their reputation.",
      "chapters": [
        1700
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_qing_yue_an",
        "char_zhang_yin",
        "char_granny_rong",
        "char_shi_miao",
        "char_duke_long",
        "sys_immortal_gu_house",
        "sys_refinement_path_convention"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "In immemorial white heaven he inspects empty sky for a long time in search of Pine Crane Pavilion, then speaks with certainty that it should be here. Song Qi Yuan stands beside him and proposes they work together. Shen Cong Sheng agrees. He wants to know why Immortal Crane Sect’s Pine Crane Pavilion came to Eastern Sea sneakily and vanished there. The two are Shen clan’s first supreme elder and Song clan’s first supreme elder. They found Pine Crane Pavilion by chance while on an important mission, recognized it as an Immortal Gu House of Central Continent’s ten great ancient sects, and followed from afar on his investigative method.",
      "chapters": [
        1836
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "search-and-interception",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "house_pine_crane_pavilion",
        "fac_immortal_crane_sect",
        "fac_shen_clan",
        "fac_song_clan",
        "fac_ten_great_ancient_sects"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "They were too far to see Fang Yuan ambush Duke Long and the house. By the time they arrive, Fang Yuan has already trapped Duke Long and Pine Crane Pavilion in a qi path battlefield. Shen Cong Sheng finds clues of a hidden immortal battlefield, and the two attack. After the battlefield breaks, Duke Long returns to Eastern Sea and they recognize him. They realize they disrupted an Eastern Sea friend’s plans and helped Heavenly Court. Fang Yuan still charges the house. Song and Shen grab Pine Crane Pavilion from the horizon. Fang Zheng shouts that he is a prospective Heavenly Court member, that he is protected by Duke Long, and that he is Fang Yuan’s brother. Shen Cong Sheng waves his hand and Fang Zheng faints. He asks Song Qi Yuan what they should do.",
      "chapters": [
        1836
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "search-and-interception",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_heavenly_court",
        "char_fang_zheng"
      ]
    }
  ],
